  "id": "voluntary-muscle",
  "term": "voluntary muscle",
  "definition": "In this context, voluntary muscle refers to muscle activity generated by a person’s intentional effort, such as trying to produce a maximal contraction. The packet discusses how pain can reduce the force of such effort-driven contractions, mainly through deficits in maximal voluntary drive or activation.",
